[size=5][b][color=#e8b99c]Credits[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]OBody NG[/b] (Aietos and contributors), for the design this follows.
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/108394]Runtime Database[/url][/b] (Zzyxzz), which lets one plugin run on every supported game version.
[*][b]LooksMenu[/b] (expired6978) and [b]BodySlide[/b] (ousnius, Caliente), for the tools it feeds.
[*]The stock presets in the pickers are CBBE's (Caliente, ousnius) and BodyTalk's (its authors). Silhouette reads their source to get their behaviour right, and ships none of it.
[/list]

Bugs go to the [b]Bugs[/b] tab, with [font=Courier New]Silhouette.log[/font] (Documents\My Games\Fallout4\F4SE), what MCM's [i]How is Silhouette doing?[/i] says, and Runtime Database's .trace and .mapping files if you have them.

